  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The book references the use of blank pages in Ed Ruscha's work, specifically "Nine Swimming Pools", "Colored People", "A Few Palm Trees", and "Various Small Fires (And Milk)", as well as the significance of the artist's works within the holdings of the Joan Flasch Artists' Book Collection. The book reproduces blank pages that might have been scanned from these titles, adds blank pages of its own, and depicts a photograph of the collection's stamp used for cataloging purposes.; Joint author: Eric Baskauskas.; Edition of 500 copies printed.</subfield>
  </datafield>
